            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GoodFood"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good but sweet. Use plain gelatin instead of jello. A little lemon will enhance the strawberry flavor. If the berries aren't that sweet add just 1/8 to 1/4 cup sugar to sweeten.",
            "datePublished": "2010-09-03T13:48:02.143Z"
          },
          {
