            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Roz Weitzman"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was awesome. I used strawberries and blueberries. As soon as you freeze or refrigerate it, the jam sets and is delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2019-04-05T11:25:31.477Z"
          },
          {
