              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ashley Redmond"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved it!!! I used raspberries instead of strawberry. It tastes wonderful, and it was so easy to make. I thought I made it wrong because it was so easy :). It seemed to runny before I put it in the freezer, but once it froze and I was ready to thaw it out, it was the PERFECT consistency!",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-24T17:38:16.163Z"
